  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simaduan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simaduan:p001:m0000" ref="7xu_sss_agn">端</persName>初封廣川王，<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simaduan:p001:m0007" ref="e9x_60x_9m9">銓</persName>之為皇太子也，轉封豫章，禮秩如皇子，拜散騎常侍、平南將軍、都督江州諸軍事、假節。當之國，會洛陽陷沒，端東奔<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simaduan:p001:m0061" ref="v5s_1ew_vh0">苟晞</persName>于蒙。晞立為皇太子，七十日，為<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simaduan:p001:m0078" ref="0c9_95a_18b">石勒</persName>所沒。</p>
</text>
